      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Thirty-six patients with orthopedic disorders were treated with proglumetacin. Therapeutic efficacy was rated as good or very good in 97% of patients. The overall mean of symptoms decreased by 75% in patients with acute diseases and by 61% in patients with chronic diseases. Tolerance was very good in all patients but one (97%)."},
